'' std/numeric, a real module since 2026-10-10 (it was a facade over fb/math.bi and the rest):
'' Complex, CAbs, Clamp, GCD; vector.bi's macro-made Vec2f and its public factory Vec2f_; a
'' const; NaN -- and under 'using numeric' Vec3d and mathint's macro-made AddChecked, whose
'' Optional result the interface had to qualify in every expansion of the macro.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/numeric.bas -o tests/modules/stdnumeric.exe
